{"type":"message","id":"8a71a9e4","parentId":"5b351afe","timestamp":"2026-04-14T22:11:32.647Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze the tasks. The current time is 1744632660 (Unix timestamp for April 14, 2026, 22:11 UTC).\n\nLet me check the tasks:\n\n1. **Weekly EBITDA reminder** (t145474) - status: todo, weekly recurring, due: 1830225600000 (March 2027) - not overdue\n2. **任务监督与检查** (d91e9834) - status: todo, daily recurring at 9am, due: 1774918800000 - let me check this timestamp\n3. **客户分析** (0338067e) - status: todo, due: 1767229200000 - this is in the past (late January 2026)\n\n\n4. **策略制定** (2907e59f) - status: todo, due: 1767229200000 - also past due\n5. **效果评估** (5e36cf06) - status: todo, due: 1767229200000 - past due\n6. **执行跟进** (635a5d64) - status: todo, due: 1767229200000 - past due\n7. **方案优化** (0c277b5f) - status: todo, due: 1767232799000 - past due\n\nI notice the recurring task监督与检查 (d91e9834) is marked as todo but has a daily trigger at 9am, so it should be active. The other five tasks are all past their due dates and need attention.\n\nNow I'm calculating how far past due these timestamps are. The dates around 1767229200000 in milliseconds convert to late January 2026, which is roughly 77 days before the current date of April 14, 2026. These are severely overdue and would definitely qualify as \"Dead\" tasks if we're flagging anything more than 60 minutes stale. I'm checking the updated_at timestamps to identify which tasks haven't been touched recently. Most of these older tasks from January 2026 show very stale update times, so they're prime candidates for the \"Dead\" status. The weekly recurring task is still current, but several of these Aily-generated tasks are over two months old and haven't been modified since creation. 这些任务都是很久以前创建的，从2026年1月底就已经停滞了，更新时间也都停留在那时。由于距今已经超过60分钟没有更新，按规则应该标记为Dead，但飞书任务API可能不支持这种标记。我需要先更新心跳时间，然后检查共享池的工作进度库，看看是否有相关的进度更新需要汇总。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_functio